## Nexora Local Properties Template
# Copy this file to local.properties and configure your local settings.

# Location of the Android SDK (configured automatically by Android Studio)
# sdk.dir=C\:\\Users\\<YourUsername>\\AppData\\Local\\Android\\Sdk

